# EC Sense ES4-AG1 VOC sensor configuration options

config ES4_AG1
	bool "EC Sense ES4-AG1 VOC sensor"
	depends on DT_HAS_ECSENSE_ES4_AG1_ENABLED
	select ADC
	help
	  Enable support for the EC Sense ES4-AG1 electrochemical VOC sensor.
	  The driver samples a TIA/amplifier output through ADC io-channels and
	  reports SENSOR_CHAN_VOLTAGE and SENSOR_CHAN_VOC.
